# Default timing-aware ABC technology mapping, matching the Yosys Liberty flow.
# Copy to submission/flow/abc_opt.script and replace the command sequence.
# {D} is replaced by the public builder with -D <requested delay in ps>.
strash;
ifraig; scorr; dc2; dretime; retime {D}; strash;
&get -n; &dch -f; &nf {D}; &put;
buffer; upsize {D}; dnsize {D}; stime -p;
# A resyn2-style alternative Boolean sequence before mapping can include:
# balance; rewrite; refactor; balance; rewrite; rewrite -z; balance;
# refactor -z; rewrite -z; balance;
# Preserve a final Liberty mapping step, e.g. map {D}, or &nf {D}; &put.
